{
  "about": "Frozen before WI-017 added any value: how the WI-026 release reads the training records that embed a scenario. Do not edit or regenerate it; a later build models this release with it (FrozenTrainingDecoder). A record without a string id, a string entry and a scenario object is damaged. A record is from a newer version when any field it holds is not listed here, or a closed vocabulary holds a value not listed here; the active attempt alone tolerates unknown fields at its top level (kept by path, and it resumes). Null is no field. 'value' is any JSON value: types and required fields are not modelled.",
